     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Keith,<div><br></div><div>you can use qplot for showing multiple time series - the easiest way would be to melt the variables into a single variable and then plot:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(10,31,153);font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">X1 </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>rnorm(<span style=\"color:#055118\">100</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(10,31,153);font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">X2 </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>rnorm(<span style=\"color:#000000\">mean</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">3</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#055118\">100</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(10,31,153);font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">X3 </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>rnorm(<span style=\"color:#000000\">mean</span>=<span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#055118\">100</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;font-size:14px\">frame <span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">data.frame(</span>X1<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>X1<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> X2<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>X2<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> X3<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>X3<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;min-height:22px;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;min-height:22px;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(10,31,153);font-size:14px\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">ggplot2</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;font-size:14px\">frame<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">$</span>id <span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span><span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">:nrow(</span>frame<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;font-size:14px\">framem <span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">melt(</span>frame<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> measure.vars<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">1</span><span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">:</span><span style=\"color:#055118\">3</span><span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">qplot(</span>id<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> value<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> group<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>variable<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> geom<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b0130e\">&quot;line&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> colour<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>variable<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">,</span> data<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">=</span>framem<span style=\"color:#0a1f99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 17px/normal Monaco\"><font color=\"#0a1f99\"><br></font></div><div><div>Heike</div></div></div></div>"
